sequenceDiagram
    participant A as review-agent@varsha.acme
    participant X as Exchange
    participant QH as varsha@acme's queue
    participant QA as review-agent@varsha.acme's queue
    participant N as Connector
    participant S as Slack
    participant H as Varsha (human)
    participant L as Ledger

    A->>X: escalate (thr_a2e8…, body: "needs judgment on rollback")
    X->>QH: enqueue envelope
    X->>L: record enqueue
    QH->>N: dial delivery (profile: chat)
    N->>S: post notification + Approve / Reject / Open
    S->>H: notify

    H->>S: taps Approve
    S->>N: interaction event
    N->>X: ingress → approve on thr_a2e8…
    X->>QA: enqueue to review-agent@varsha.acme
    X->>L: record envelope
    QA->>N: dial delivery (profile: a2a)
    N->>A: approve

    note over N,S: Structured actions map to approve/reject.<br/>Free-text replies map to respond carrying the<br/>inline body (≤ 12 KB). The verb set stays closed.
    note over X,L: The reply re-enters through the Exchange's normal<br/>public API as a call from varsha@acme — no privileged<br/>inbound path, no side channel, same ledger treatment.
